abstract: >
  Monthly aggregate statistics measuring how SEC filings moved US stocks:
  AI importance score (1-10) and disclosure sentiment versus next-session
  excess price moves, split by filing family and market-cap bucket.
  Aggregates only; no per-filing rows. Canonical: https://wiseek.ai/datasets/
